      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Solomon Valley Railroad, a branch of the Kansas Pacific Railroad, reached Bennington in 1878, linking the town to regional trade.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3,
