      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bennington%2C_Kansas",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In 1938, Bennington added an auditorium, followed by a shop in 1955 and a new grade school building in 1961.",
